{'symbol': 'NDSN', 'date': '2023-02-10 08:30:00', 'title': 'NORDSON CORPORATION APPOINTS SARAH SIDDIQUI AS CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER', 'text': 'WESTLAKE, OHIO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NORDSON CORPORATION (NASDAQ: NDSN) ANNOUNCED THAT SARAH SIDDIQUI HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER, EFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 20, 2023. MS. SIDDIQUI SUCCEEDS SHELLY PEET, WHO HAD PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED HER INTENTION TO RETIRE. MS.'}